WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.223
Unit eight. A Healthy Breakfast!

2
00:00:04.174 --> 00:00:07.941
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.991 --> 00:00:11.227
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:15.016
Today we learn about A Healthy Breakfast. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.704 --> 00:00:19.221
Breakfast. Say it with me. Breakfast!

6
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.170
Rice. Say it with me. Rice!

7
00:00:29.679 --> 00:00:32.829
Egg. Say it with me. Egg!

8
00:00:36.312 --> 00:00:39.912
Porridge. Say it with me. Porridge!

9
00:00:43.412 --> 00:00:46.678
Fruit. Say it with me. Fruit!

10
00:00:50.202 --> 00:00:53.718
Milk. Say it with me. Milk!

11
00:00:57.214 --> 00:01:00.680
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

12
00:01:04.173 --> 00:01:07.856
Morning. Say it with me. Morning!

13
00:01:11.344 --> 00:01:20.297
Breakfast gives me energy for the morning. I might eat rice porridge, an egg, fruit, or drink milk. After breakfast, it is easier to learn and play.

14
00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:21.598
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.102 --> 00:01:28.279
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.329 --> 00:01:29.367
Egg!

17
00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:35.241
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.291 --> 00:01:36.441
Energy!

19
00:01:37.406 --> 00:01:43.300
Did you know? Children who eat breakfast often find it easier to pay attention in class!

20
00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:45.342
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:53.642
Think and answer. What did you eat for breakfast today?

22
00:01:53.692 --> 00:01:54.842
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.022 --> 00:02:00.791
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.841 --> 00:02:03.390
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

